<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Scottish Hydro.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman cuts Scottish Hydro.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Hydro-Electric Plc was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Goldman upped its share price target to 403p from 368p, yet the new target is only just above the stock's current market value.</p>
<p>Further detail on Goldman's recommendation change were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 2p at 390 by 1031 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
